{
  "version": 6,
  "instance": "{{ backrest_instance }}",
  "_comment": "SEED-ONCE (roles/pazny.backrest, force:false). The backrest daemon OWNS this file and rewrites it (adds sync.identity, ids, modno). Repos/plans below are seeded from the existing restic_repo when set; edit further in the UI. WARNING, corrected 2026-08-23: this comment used to say 'auth.disabled is safe: backrest binds loopback only'. That is FALSE and was measured false — REM-214 issued POST /v1.Backrest/GetConfig from inside devops-gitea-1 and got 200 with the daemon reporting its own auth:disabled. A 127.0.0.1 bind constrains only HOST callers; Docker Desktop forwards host-gateway to the host loopback, and 23 containers carry such an alias (REM-194 established the same for peer containers). The Traefik forward-auth edge gate is real and guards the EDGE; it guards nothing on the fabric. Backrest's config surface includes hook commands, so a caller able to write here is a caller able to schedule commands. Turning auth on is roadmap sec-backrest-auth and is not a template edit: this file is seed-once, so the live config must be reconciled and a bcrypt credential minted.",
  "auth": {
    "disabled": true
  }{% if (restic_repo | default('')) | length > 0 %},
  "repos": [
    {
      "id": "offsite",
      "uri": "{{ restic_repo }}",
      "password": "{{ restic_password }}",
      "autoInitialize": true,
      "prunePolicy": { "schedule": { "maxFrequencyDays": 7 }, "maxUnusedPercent": 10 },
      "checkPolicy": { "schedule": { "maxFrequencyDays": 30 }, "readDataSubsetPercent": 5 },
      "hooks": [
        {
          "conditions": ["CONDITION_ANY_ERROR"],
          "actionCommand": { "command": "{{ backrest_home }}/backrest-notify.sh high 'backrest: backup/check/prune error on {{ backrest_instance }}'" }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "plans": [
    {
      "id": "nos-offsite",
      "repo": "offsite",
      "paths": ["{{ rustfs_data_dir | default(ansible_facts['env']['HOME'] + '/rustfs') }}"],
      "schedule": { "cron": "0 4 * * *", "clock": "CLOCK_LOCAL" },
      "retention": { "policyTimeBucketed": { "daily": {{ backup_retention_daily | default(7) }}, "weekly": {{ backup_retention_weekly | default(4) }}, "monthly": {{ backup_retention_monthly | default(12) }} } }
    }
  ]
{% endif %}
}
